# Email delivery for the contact form (https://resend.com)
# Without these two set, the form tells visitors to email harry@ directly
# instead of silently discarding the enquiry.
#
# Both are set on Vercel for Production and Preview. They are NOT set for
# Development, so `next dev` deliberately takes the "email us directly"
# branch rather than sending real mail from a local machine.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Must be an address on a domain verified in Resend. Live value:
CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@weltonproperty.co.uk
